	/// ADDED 2026-11-04 (Fabric app): Actual revenue / allocated FTE (last week). Monthly context only.
	/// FIXED 2026-11-05 (Fabric app): Adan's Revenue per FTE (actual revenue ÷ last-week allocation FTE) on the Sunday–Saturday week and, with an org filter, the project org's FTE. Monthly context only.
	measure 'Revenue per FTE_app' = DIVIDE ( [Actual Revenue_app], [Allocated FTE (Last Week, Project Org)_app], 0 )
		formatString: \$#,0;(\$#,0);\$#,0
		displayFolder: _app\Yield
